Common SurveyQuestionResponseValue
  documentation "Individual response to a free-form, single- or multiple-selection survey question."
  integer SurveyQuestionResponseValueIdentifier
    documentation "Primary key for the response value; a unique, usually sequential numeric value for a collection of responses, or potentially the value of NumericResponse for a single response."
    is part of identity
  shared integer NumericResponse
    documentation "A numeric response to the question."
    is optional
  shared string TextResponse
    documentation "A text response to the question."
    is optional
